  ],
  "explanation": "The pipeline begins with the Strategic Architect generating a comprehensive initial plan. The Business Model Refiner improves coherence and specificity, then the Plan Quality Gate reviews it; if gaps exist, it loops back to the refiner for correction. Once the plan passes, the Revenue Analyst quantifies the trough and pricing sensitivity. The Financial Integration Refiner merges those insights into the plan. A Final Quality Gate iteratively validates the integrated output, looping back to the Financial Integration Refiner up to three times if needed, before the Executive Polisher produces the final board-ready document."
